Added in 756375c274 (`src/store/file/slices/chat/action.test.ts`):
- isolation: uploads dispatched to two keys stay separate, and clearing one leaves the other untouched;
- `moveChatComposerAttachments` moves staged uploads and context selections to the new key, merging with what is already there;
- in-flight move: an upload is moved mid-flight and a same-named file is staged under the old key. The first upload's result lands on its moved chip, and the newer chip stays pending. This test fails against c0ab2cdc13 (the id-based lookup) and passes on the fix.

